01:10:14.745 --> 01:10:16.804
What a lovely suit.


01:10:21.385 --> 01:10:22.477
Move it.


01:10:22.653 --> 01:10:25.053
Hey. Out of the way. Out of the way.
Michael, go on.


01:10:25.222 --> 01:10:27.486
