I'll see you at the end.


01:10:27.658 --> 01:10:29.523
Guy. Tom. Tom.


01:10:30.160 --> 01:10:31.559
I'll be right back.


01:10:34.097 --> 01:10:35.359
Good to see you.


01:10:35.532 --> 01:10:37.397
Nice suit.


01:10:44.241 --> 01:10:48.177
What was that back there?
This is your last chance to get it right.


01:10:48.345 --> 01:10:51.314
Unless you wanna see
Angela's Juilliard dreams go bye-bye.


01:10:51.481 --> 01:10:55.440
That what you wanna be? A little
dwarfish Asian girl's dream crusher, huh?


01:10:55.619 --> 01:10:56.643
