- No. No.


01:10:56.820 --> 01:10:59.687
No? No? No? Then focus!


01:11:05.195 --> 01:11:07.857
- Look, Ange, you...
- Gail's been threatening me too.


01:11:08.031 --> 01:11:10.056
That's why you're doing
what she wants.


01:11:10.400 --> 01:11:12.698
