- Ange.


01:11:13.303 --> 01:11:15.237
You're my best friend.


01:11:15.405 --> 01:11:17.839
Look, I'd do anything for you.


01:11:28.318 --> 01:11:30.149
Okay.


01:11:32.389 --> 01:11:36.917
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:42.766 --> 01:11:43.790
Scratch that.


01:11:43.967 --> 01:11:46.902
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:55.612 --> 01:11:58.080
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:11:58.248 --> 01:12:02.150
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:04.955 --> 01:12:06.320
Move it. Guy.


01:12:06.490 --> 01:12:10.688
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:10.861 --> 01:12:12.328
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:12.496 --> 01:12:15.363
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
Here, let me get that for you.


01:12:16.800 --> 01:12:17.994
Well, it had better be.


01:12:18.168 --> 01:12:19.396
I have to pee.


01:12:19.569 --> 01:12:22.800
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:25.742 --> 01:12:27.573
Sorry.


01:12:28.011 --> 01:12:30.536
<i>So keep on knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


01:12:30.714 --> 01:12:35.651
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


01:12:36.386 --> 01:12:38.547
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:38.722 --> 01:12:41.782
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:41.958 --> 01:12:44.324
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:44.494 --> 01:12:47.827
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:52.636 --> 01:12:53.967
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:54.137 --> 01:12:55.536
Okay.


01:12:55.872 --> 01:12:58.033
You guys having a good time?


01:12:58.608 --> 01:13:03.011
Let's keep it going
with Beverly Van Ravensway.


01:13:15.125 --> 01:13:17.355
<i>Plug in the mike</i>


01:13:17.527 --> 01:13:18.824
