01:13:57.134 --> 01:14:00.831
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:14:01.004 --> 01:14:05.407
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:14:05.575 --> 01:14:07.042
<i>I can be what you want...</i>


01:14:10.914 --> 01:14:11.938
Give me...


01:14:18.622 --> 01:14:22.718
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:23.126 --> 01:14:25.617
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:28.498 --> 01:14:30.625
<i>I don't know.
- Give me that. Give me that.</i>


01:14:35.839 --> 01:14:40.071
How dare you sabotage your mother,
