01:15:04.034 --> 01:15:05.831
No, no, no. You gotta get out of here.


01:15:06.236 --> 01:15:09.535
You're about to sing for Bev.
Why are you about to sing for Bev?


01:15:10.474 --> 01:15:11.498
She can't sing.


01:15:17.948 --> 01:15:19.210
Come on.


01:15:19.382 --> 01:15:21.282
Hey. All of you, keep playing.


01:15:21.952 --> 01:15:23.749
Keep playing, you idiots.


01:15:23.920 --> 01:15:26.218
It was your voice the whole time?
Bev never sang at all?


01:15:27.824 --> 01:15:31.191
And she's about to not sing
for a whole bunch of people, so please...


01:15:31.361 --> 01:15:34.558
And on the dates, that... That was you.


01:15:39.002 --> 01:15:41.129
<i>I got nothing to lose</i>


01:15:41.638 --> 01:15:43.003
<i>I've been exposed</i>


01:15:43.173 --> 01:15:45.300
<i>I'm paying my dues</i>


01:15:45.475 --> 01:15:46.635
<i>Playing the role</i>


01:15:46.810 --> 01:15:49.176
<i>I'm breaking the rules</i>


01:15:49.346 --> 01:15:50.540
<i>Flow in the flow</i>


01:15:50.714 --> 01:15:54.673
<i>I got the whole world nodding, yes
Like some bobbleheads</i>


01:15:54.851 --> 01:15:56.216
<i>I'll break a sweat</i>


01:15:57.420 --> 01:15:58.444
<i>If you want it</i>


01:15:58.622 --> 01:16:00.749
<i>Confess all your sins</i>


01:16:00.924 --> 01:16:02.221
<i>You know you got 'em</i>


01:16:02.392 --> 01:16:04.656
<i>The room's in a spin</i>


01:16:04.828 --> 01:16:05.852
<i>The fever's pitched</i>


01:16:06.029 --> 01:16:07.997
- You gotta go. Come on, get out there.
Aah!


01:16:08.164 --> 01:16:09.961
<i>I'm legit, I'm no counterfeit</i>


01:16:10.133 --> 01:16:14.593
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:14.771 --> 01:16:17.535
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:17.707 --> 01:16:21.370
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:21.545 --> 01:16:25.174
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:25.348 --> 01:16:29.751
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:16:29.920 --> 01:16:31.114
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:16:31.288 --> 01:16:34.086
Hey! Shut that camera down! Now!


01:16:34.257 --> 01:16:36.725
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:36.893 --> 01:16:40.795
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:40.964 --> 01:16:43.057
<i>You want from me</i>


01:16:49.506 --> 01:16:51.303
That's what I'm talking about.


01:16:53.143 --> 01:16:55.634
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:16:58.782 --> 01:17:01.182
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:17:04.487 --> 01:17:05.852
Hey. Clear.


01:17:08.959 --> 01:17:11.359
<i>Sing something else.
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:11.528 --> 01:17:12.825
Like what?


01:17:13.096 --> 01:17:14.961
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:15.131 --> 01:17:16.928
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:17.100 --> 01:17:22.470
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:25.241 --> 01:17:27.209
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:34.918 --> 01:17:38.911
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:42.025 --> 01:17:46.655
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:47.897 --> 01:17:51.458
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:51.635 --> 01:17:53.125
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:55.105 --> 01:17:58.541
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:17:58.708 --> 01:18:01.871
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:18:02.045 --> 01:18:04.980
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:18:05.148 --> 01:18:06.775
<i>There's no one to blame</i>


01:18:06.950 --> 01:18:12.684
<i>There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:18:12.856 --> 01:18:16.155
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:16.326 --> 01:18:19.295
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:19.462 --> 01:18:22.659
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:22.832 --> 01:18:25.232
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:25.402 --> 01:18:28.530
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:30.006 --> 01:18:36.878
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:37.047 --> 01:18:40.710
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:40.884 --> 01:18:47.881
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:48.058 --> 01:18:51.323
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:51.494 --> 01:18:54.395
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:54.564 --> 01:19:01.993
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:19:02.172 --> 01:19:05.369
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:05.542 --> 01:19:08.511
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:08.678 --> 01:19:11.772
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:11.948 --> 01:19:14.439
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:14.617 --> 01:19:17.347
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:34.871 --> 01:19:36.532
Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.


01:19:36.706 --> 01:19:40.107
We hope you enjoyed the Wellesley
Academy of Arts Showcase.


01:19:40.276 --> 01:19:42.836
Oh, my God, you were so good.


01:19:43.213 --> 01:19:45.545
Who are you?
You're like a freaking rock star.


01:19:45.715 --> 01:19:47.808
Are you kidding me? Man, she likes you...


01:19:59.028 --> 01:20:01.963
So, what did he say? Is he mad?


01:20:02.132 --> 01:20:03.793
Yeah. He's pretty ticked off...


01:20:03.967 --> 01:20:07.733
...that I'm not already making
the next big album for Kensington Records.


01:20:09.706 --> 01:20:11.469
Oh. Which album?


01:20:12.375 --> 01:20:13.399
Your album.


01:20:15.078 --> 01:20:17.069
- Are you kidding me?
- No.


01:20:18.681 --> 01:20:21.149
- You're... You're serious?
- Uh-huh.


01:20:23.386 --> 01:20:24.717
Go for it.


01:20:24.888 --> 01:20:27.652
We're making an album.
And we're writing it together.


01:20:27.824 --> 01:20:29.883
Yeah! Yeah!
I'm so happy.


01:20:30.059 --> 01:20:31.856
You know, I sing too.


01:20:32.028 --> 01:20:35.657
I can do a whole monologue album.
Incredible. Hey, congratulations.


01:20:35.832 --> 01:20:40.360
- Yo, blow it up. Boom.
I'm your boy. Call me up.


01:20:40.537 --> 01:20:43.938
Yeah. Yeah, he's really good
at guitars. He's a kook.


01:20:58.655 --> 01:21:00.247
Guy! Wait!


01:21:00.423 --> 01:21:03.915
