- Well, everyone lies in this business.


01:21:04.093 --> 01:21:05.117
It's called spin.


01:21:05.762 --> 01:21:07.127
So Bev can't sing.


01:21:07.297 --> 01:21:09.026
That didn't stop Jessica Simpson.


01:21:09.199 --> 01:21:12.794
Well, we'll see what the school board
thinks when I get them a ring, shall we?


01:21:13.169 --> 01:21:15.967
