Guy!


01:21:23.079 --> 01:21:26.742
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:26.983 --> 01:21:30.749
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:32.222 --> 01:21:35.282
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:35.458 --> 01:21:38.052
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:38.228 --> 01:21:39.786
Let's try this again.


01:21:39.996 --> 01:21:41.861
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:43.433 --> 01:21:46.163
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:11.828 --> 01:22:14.058
Hey. Clear.


01:22:29.746 --> 01:22:31.907
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:32.081 --> 01:22:34.447
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:16.326 --> 01:23:18.920
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:19.095 --> 01:23:21.962
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:26.936 --> 01:23:30.463
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:36.913 --> 01:23:38.972
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:44.153 --> 01:23:48.453
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:52.895 --> 01:23:55.887
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:56.065 --> 01:23:58.192
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:17.687 --> 01:24:19.552
I love my life.


01:24:19.722 --> 01:24:21.917
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:44.380 --> 01:24:47.577
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

